# EXPECT: needs at least 1 value of
# A SWOT analysis with a strength only: weakness, opportunity and threat are missing.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:BadSwot a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:SWOTAnalysis ; rdfs:label "Incomplete SWOT" ; o4de:hasStrength o4de:BadStrength .
o4de:BadStrength a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:Strength ; rdfs:label "A strength" .
